    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Ein Zeitplan-Eintrag zum Setzen ueber <ref refid="class_file_system_1a889429cfca465871ed1935d4537381b9" kindref="member">setSchedule()</ref>. <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_file_system_1_1_schedule_input_1adf1de82adde52bb254b9be3af6ad84c9" kindref="member">weekdaysMask</ref></computeroutput> (Bit 0=Montag.. 6=Sonntag) ist nur bei type=WEEKLY relevant, <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_file_system_1_1_schedule_input_1a0ac3fb2003f54af770403c601f3175ae" kindref="member">year</ref></computeroutput>/<computeroutput><ref refid="struct_file_system_1_1_schedule_input_1aceb676cdce7f77480a183dea15ee1e22" kindref="member">month</ref></computeroutput>/<computeroutput><ref refid="struct_file_system_1_1_schedule_input_1ae745cc192f5a29c76c55df1b91690bf9" kindref="member">day</ref></computeroutput> nur bei type=ONCE - siehe docs/spec/15-wochenplan.md. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
